                <pb facs="0566" n="516" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg516"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Document No. 5.—From the legation of Portugal at
                        Rio de Janeiro.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-12"><hi rendition="#small-caps">March</hi> 12,
                        1894</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister of foreign affairs says Federal Government can not accept condition
                    proposed in behalf of military rebels.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paraty.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
